<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.889 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.889 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.889 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.886 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    December 30	  December 28</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.889		  1.886</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $0,74 million	    $2,35 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
